      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ex #3836 - おいしそうに見える食べ物 could simply be　おいしそうな食べ物?\n\nI'm more asking than correcting",
      "html": "ex #3836 - おいしそうに見える食べ物 could simply be　おいしそうな食べ物?<br/><br/>I'm more asking than correcting",
